<title>ESTONIA: HANSA FINNISH ROAD SHOW ATTRACTS HIGH INTEREST.</title>
<headline>HANSA FINNISH ROAD SHOW ATTRACTS HIGH INTEREST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansabank said on Friday that its road show presentation to Finnish investors this week was a success.</p>
<p>Hansa was invited to give the presentations by Merita Bank and Williams de Broe Pankkiiriliike.</p>
<p>&quot;The interest towards Hansabank was very high and the participation was large,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The investors were especially interested in Hansabank's extension plans and whether it can maintain high capital returns, it added.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
